[[:db/add "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c" :answer/id #uuid "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c"] [:db/add "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c" :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{\\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}{2}} - 1}"] [:db/ensure "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323" :answer/id #uuid "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323"] [:db/add "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323" :answer/value "y=\\frac{2}{2 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{\\left(x+5\\right)^{2}} + 1}"] [:db/ensure "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323" :answer/validate] [:db/add "05a764a0-688a-5f0e-a394-b1e79f141e79" :answer/id #uuid "05a764a0-688a-5f0e-a394-b1e79f141e79"] [:db/add "05a764a0-688a-5f0e-a394-b1e79f141e79" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "05a764a0-688a-5f0e-a394-b1e79f141e79" :answer/value "y=\\frac{2}{2 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{\\left(x+5\\right)^{2}} - 1}"] [:db/ensure "05a764a0-688a-5f0e-a394-b1e79f141e79" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0a2ba7b5-54ce-5538-be65-a8f53b901840" :answer/id #uuid "0a2ba7b5-54ce-5538-be65-a8f53b901840"] [:db/add "0a2ba7b5-54ce-5538-be65-a8f53b901840" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0a2ba7b5-54ce-5538-be65-a8f53b901840" :answer/value "y=\\frac{1}{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{3 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}{2}} + 1}"] [:db/ensure "0a2ba7b5-54ce-5538-be65-a8f53b901840" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915" :answer/id #uuid "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915"] [:db/add "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915" :answer/value "y=\\frac{3}{3 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{\\frac{3 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}{2}} + 2}"] [:db/ensure "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915" :answer/validate] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/id #uuid "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/choices "5e2255c5-232a-537b-a15b-31fad33d524c"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/choices "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/choices "05a764a0-688a-5f0e-a394-b1e79f141e79"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/choices "0a2ba7b5-54ce-5538-be65-a8f53b901840"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/choices "5a38801e-0944-513c-b15f-776143dfd915"] [:db/add "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/correct "857e71a6-9966-5a31-aae6-7d316fcf2323"] [:db/ensure "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03" :question/id #uuid "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03"] [:db/add "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03" :question/problem "Find the general nonzero real solution to the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}+2 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right) \\cdot y=\\left(x+5\\right) \\cdot y^{2}.\n$$\n\nWork on an interval where $\\left(x+5\\right)>0$. Choose constants and intervals on which the displayed expressions are real and finite.\n\n{{selection}}"] [:db/add "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03" :question/worked-solution "This is a Bernoulli equation with\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}p(x)&=2 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right)\\\\ q(x)&=\\left(x+5\\right)\\\\ n&=2.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivide by $y^{2}$ and set $z=y^{-1}$. The chain rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{y^{2}}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$$\n\nHence the linear equation in standard form is\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}+\\left(- 2 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right)\\right)z=- \\left(x+5\\right).$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$I(x)=e^{\\int - 2 \\cdot \\left(x+5\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}x}=e^{- \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}.$$\n\nMultiplying through and using the product rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(e^{- \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}\\,z\\right)=- \\left(x+5\\right) \\cdot e^{- \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}.$$\n\nIntegrating with respect to $x$, we obtain\n\n$$e^{- \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}z=\\frac{e^{- \\left(x+5\\right)^{2}}}{2}+C.$$\n\nThus\n\n$$z=C \\cdot e^{\\left(x+5\\right)^{2}} + \\frac{1}{2}.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{-1}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\frac{2}{2 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{\\left(x+5\\right)^{2}} + 1}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals."] [:db/add "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03" :question/answer-fields "37fce50a-669c-5904-b80e-2fbfd3c0cec3"] [:db/ensure "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/questions "f42d077c-e368-53a5-991d-e999c0fb2c03"] [:db/add "4d56d7e9-d563-5355-967b-957ca3f2b2b3" :answer/id #uuid "4d56d7e9-d563-5355-967b-957ca3f2b2b3"] [:db/add "4d56d7e9-d563-5355-967b-957ca3f2b2b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4d56d7e9-d563-5355-967b-957ca3f2b2b3" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{10 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} - 1}"] [:db/ensure "4d56d7e9-d563-5355-967b-957ca3f2b2b3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377" :answer/id #uuid "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377"] [:db/add "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{10 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} + \\frac{1}{2}}"] [:db/ensure "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ee9a6a0c-e58b-5f2a-b4e1-e7a057e2e002" :answer/id #uuid "ee9a6a0c-e58b-5f2a-b4e1-e7a057e2e002"] [:db/add "ee9a6a0c-e58b-5f2a-b4e1-e7a057e2e002" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ee9a6a0c-e58b-5f2a-b4e1-e7a057e2e002" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} - 3}"] [:db/ensure "ee9a6a0c-e58b-5f2a-b4e1-e7a057e2e002" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ccd26068-c8b0-5974-9881-80cb506bef69" :answer/id #uuid "ccd26068-c8b0-5974-9881-80cb506bef69"] [:db/add "ccd26068-c8b0-5974-9881-80cb506bef69" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ccd26068-c8b0-5974-9881-80cb506bef69" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} - 1}"] [:db/ensure "ccd26068-c8b0-5974-9881-80cb506bef69" :answer/validate] [:db/add "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54" :answer/id #uuid "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54"] [:db/add "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54" :answer/value "y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} + 3}"] [:db/ensure "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54" :answer/validate] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/id #uuid "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/choices "4d56d7e9-d563-5355-967b-957ca3f2b2b3"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/choices "6f8c9224-7464-5b3d-9481-901d66114377"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/choices "ee9a6a0c-e58b-5f2a-b4e1-e7a057e2e002"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/choices "ccd26068-c8b0-5974-9881-80cb506bef69"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/choices "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54"] [:db/add "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/correct "af482571-f59f-510d-8968-932276b6af54"] [:db/ensure "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f" :question/id #uuid "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f"] [:db/add "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f" :question/problem "Find the general nonzero real solution to the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}- \\left(x+2\\right)^{2} \\cdot y=- \\frac{3 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{2}}{y^{4}}.\n$$\n\nWork on an interval where $\\left(x+2\\right)>0$. Choose constants and intervals on which the displayed expressions are real and finite.\n\n{{selection}}"] [:db/add "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f" :question/worked-solution "This is a Bernoulli equation with\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}p(x)&=- \\left(x+2\\right)^{2}\\\\ q(x)&=- 3 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{2}\\\\ n&=-4.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivide by $y^{-4}$ and set $z=y^{5}$. The chain rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}=5 \\cdot y^{4}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$$\n\nHence the linear equation in standard form is\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}+\\left(- 5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{2}\\right)z=- 15 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{2}.$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$I(x)=e^{\\int - 5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x}=e^{- \\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}}.$$\n\nMultiplying through and using the product rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(e^{- \\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}}\\,z\\right)=- 15 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{2} \\cdot e^{- \\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}}.$$\n\nIntegrating with respect to $x$, we obtain\n\n$$e^{- \\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}}z=3 \\cdot e^{- \\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}}+C.$$\n\nThus\n\n$$z=C \\cdot e^{\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} + 3.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{5}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\sqrt[5]{C \\cdot e^{\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+2\\right)^{3}}{3}} + 3}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals."] [:db/add "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f" :question/answer-fields "46f8b52d-7488-5cfe-96a2-6f6270c23b92"] [:db/ensure "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/questions "c98ebde1-9cae-55b5-a3ae-6eb0a074c80f"] [:db/add "63a0a3f6-7a6e-53d0-870b-cb1f0d8e828e" :answer/id #uuid "63a0a3f6-7a6e-53d0-870b-cb1f0d8e828e"] [:db/add "63a0a3f6-7a6e-53d0-870b-cb1f0d8e828e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "63a0a3f6-7a6e-53d0-870b-cb1f0d8e828e" :answer/value "y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{3 \\cdot x}{2}} + \\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{2}"] [:db/ensure "63a0a3f6-7a6e-53d0-870b-cb1f0d8e828e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "27053826-774a-5778-a46c-55339c8259ad" :answer/id #uuid "27053826-774a-5778-a46c-55339c8259ad"] [:db/add "27053826-774a-5778-a46c-55339c8259ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "27053826-774a-5778-a46c-55339c8259ad" :answer/value "y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} + 3\\right)^{2}"] [:db/ensure "27053826-774a-5778-a46c-55339c8259ad" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01" :answer/id #uuid "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01"] [:db/add "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01" :answer/value "y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} - 2\\right)^{2}"] [:db/ensure "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01" :answer/validate] [:db/add "86cd5af9-33cf-57f3-a021-5cd4130bfe9d" :answer/id #uuid "86cd5af9-33cf-57f3-a021-5cd4130bfe9d"] [:db/add "86cd5af9-33cf-57f3-a021-5cd4130bfe9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "86cd5af9-33cf-57f3-a021-5cd4130bfe9d" :answer/value "y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} - 1\\right)^{2}"] [:db/ensure "86cd5af9-33cf-57f3-a021-5cd4130bfe9d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c6af010a-d598-520a-bb6d-0ecb2c8813c1" :answer/id #uuid "c6af010a-d598-520a-bb6d-0ecb2c8813c1"] [:db/add "c6af010a-d598-520a-bb6d-0ecb2c8813c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c6af010a-d598-520a-bb6d-0ecb2c8813c1" :answer/value "y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{3 \\cdot x}{2}} + \\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{2}"] [:db/ensure "c6af010a-d598-520a-bb6d-0ecb2c8813c1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/id #uuid "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/choices "63a0a3f6-7a6e-53d0-870b-cb1f0d8e828e"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/choices "27053826-774a-5778-a46c-55339c8259ad"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/choices "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/choices "86cd5af9-33cf-57f3-a021-5cd4130bfe9d"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/choices "c6af010a-d598-520a-bb6d-0ecb2c8813c1"] [:db/add "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/correct "7920eb08-55a3-5637-8b43-d9eaab143d01"] [:db/ensure "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2" :question/id #uuid "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2"] [:db/add "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2" :question/problem "Find the general nonzero real solution to the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}- y=2 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}.\n$$ Take $y>0$. For even powers and powers of $2/3$ in the choices, retain only intervals where the base is positive. Choose constants and intervals on which the displayed expressions are real and finite.\n\n{{selection}}"] [:db/add "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2" :question/worked-solution "This is a Bernoulli equation with\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}p(x)&=-1\\\\ q(x)&=2\\\\ n&=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivide by $y^{\\frac{1}{2}}$ and set $z=y^{\\frac{1}{2}}$. The chain rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$$\n\nHence the linear equation in standard form is\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}+\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)z=1.$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$I(x)=e^{\\int - \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x}=e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.$$\n\nMultiplying through and using the product rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\,z\\right)=e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.$$\n\nIntegrating with respect to $x$, we obtain\n\n$$e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}z=- 2 \\cdot e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}+C.$$\n\nThus\n\n$$z=C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} - 2.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{\\frac{1}{2}}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\left(C \\cdot e^{\\frac{x}{2}} - 2\\right)^{2}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals. The displayed expression for $z$ must be positive because $z=y^{\\frac{1}{2}}>0$."] [:db/add "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2" :question/answer-fields "70ed373a-f44b-519c-bee2-72da579302ce"] [:db/ensure "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/questions "63e30119-1a5b-5cbc-bb91-0a68fadb5bb2"] [:db/add "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d" :answer/id #uuid "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d"] [:db/add "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d" :answer/value "y=\\frac{9 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{3}}{9 \\cdot C - 2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{9}{2}}}"] [:db/ensure "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06" :answer/id #uuid "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06"] [:db/add "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06" :answer/value "y=\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)}{5 \\cdot C + 2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{5}{2}}}"] [:db/ensure "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f4645217-8b7e-504b-a22d-f5a0e6956ecc" :answer/id #uuid "f4645217-8b7e-504b-a22d-f5a0e6956ecc"] [:db/add "f4645217-8b7e-504b-a22d-f5a0e6956ecc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f4645217-8b7e-504b-a22d-f5a0e6956ecc" :answer/value "y=\\frac{7 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{2}}{7 \\cdot C + 4 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{7}{2}}}"] [:db/ensure "f4645217-8b7e-504b-a22d-f5a0e6956ecc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "902ea5b5-35a5-540e-b609-df04938119bc" :answer/id #uuid "902ea5b5-35a5-540e-b609-df04938119bc"] [:db/add "902ea5b5-35a5-540e-b609-df04938119bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "902ea5b5-35a5-540e-b609-df04938119bc" :answer/value "y=\\frac{9 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{3}}{9 \\cdot C + 2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{9}{2}}}"] [:db/ensure "902ea5b5-35a5-540e-b609-df04938119bc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0" :answer/id #uuid "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0"] [:db/add "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0" :answer/value "y=\\frac{7 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{2}}{7 \\cdot C - 6 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{7}{2}}}"] [:db/ensure "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/id #uuid "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/choices "53da8360-1ce2-54da-adcb-fc0a51f23a2d"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/choices "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/choices "f4645217-8b7e-504b-a22d-f5a0e6956ecc"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/choices "902ea5b5-35a5-540e-b609-df04938119bc"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/choices "6fdabab2-bb4f-5c10-8bcd-1244abaa3cd0"] [:db/add "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/correct "3c2c23da-b34b-5ab9-b132-1f49740e6c06"] [:db/ensure "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" :question/id #uuid "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197"] [:db/add "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" :question/problem "Find the general nonzero real solution to the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}- \\frac{y}{\\left(x+3\\right)}=- \\sqrt{\\left(x+3\\right)} \\cdot y^{2}.\n$$\n\nWork on an interval where $\\left(x+3\\right)>0$. Choose constants and intervals on which the displayed expressions are real and finite.\n\n{{selection}}"] [:db/add "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" :question/worked-solution "This is a Bernoulli equation with\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}p(x)&=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\\\ q(x)&=- \\sqrt{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\\\ n&=2.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivide by $y^{2}$ and set $z=y^{-1}$. The chain rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{y^{2}}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$$\n\nHence the linear equation in standard form is\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}+\\left(\\frac{1}{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\right)z=\\sqrt{\\left(x+3\\right)}.$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$I(x)=e^{\\int \\frac{1}{\\left(x+3\\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x}=\\left(x+3\\right).$$\n\nMultiplying through and using the product rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(\\left(x+3\\right)\\,z\\right)=\\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}.$$\n\nIntegrating with respect to $x$, we obtain\n\n$$\\left(x+3\\right)z=\\frac{2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{5}{2}}}{5}+C.$$\n\nThus\n\n$$z=\\frac{C}{\\left(x+3\\right)} + \\frac{2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}{5}.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{-1}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\frac{5 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)}{5 \\cdot C + 2 \\cdot \\left(x+3\\right)^{\\frac{5}{2}}}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals."] [:db/add "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" :question/answer-fields "5fddbb82-af92-5514-a0b4-32c7712b6ca3"] [:db/ensure "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/questions "5801f052-b0ad-5933-bf26-c141fa478197"] [:db/add "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c" :answer/id #uuid "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c"] [:db/add "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c" :answer/value "y=\\pm\\sqrt{- \\frac{4}{- 4 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{4 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 4 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 1}}"] [:db/ensure "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f" :answer/id #uuid "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f"] [:db/add "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f" :answer/value "y=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{6}{6 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 1}}"] [:db/ensure "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b3a8cc80-e0bf-54ce-9bf9-ff81ebc9261f" :answer/id #uuid "b3a8cc80-e0bf-54ce-9bf9-ff81ebc9261f"] [:db/add "b3a8cc80-e0bf-54ce-9bf9-ff81ebc9261f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b3a8cc80-e0bf-54ce-9bf9-ff81ebc9261f" :answer/value "y=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{8}{8 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{4 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 12 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 3}}"] [:db/ensure "b3a8cc80-e0bf-54ce-9bf9-ff81ebc9261f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "906b9ddc-81e6-511c-bf11-8c2edb395b02" :answer/id #uuid "906b9ddc-81e6-511c-bf11-8c2edb395b02"] [:db/add "906b9ddc-81e6-511c-bf11-8c2edb395b02" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "906b9ddc-81e6-511c-bf11-8c2edb395b02" :answer/value "y=\\pm\\sqrt{- \\frac{1}{- C \\cdot e^{2 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 2 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 1}}"] [:db/ensure "906b9ddc-81e6-511c-bf11-8c2edb395b02" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8807cf27-732b-520d-95fb-8fd18cb5b26d" :answer/id #uuid "8807cf27-732b-520d-95fb-8fd18cb5b26d"] [:db/add "8807cf27-732b-520d-95fb-8fd18cb5b26d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8807cf27-732b-520d-95fb-8fd18cb5b26d" :answer/value "y=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{C \\cdot e^{2 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 2 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 1}}"] [:db/ensure "8807cf27-732b-520d-95fb-8fd18cb5b26d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/id #uuid "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/choices "4ed69f91-4032-5c77-a624-ac7493dade1c"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/choices "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/choices "b3a8cc80-e0bf-54ce-9bf9-ff81ebc9261f"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/choices "906b9ddc-81e6-511c-bf11-8c2edb395b02"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/choices "8807cf27-732b-520d-95fb-8fd18cb5b26d"] [:db/add "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/correct "5109e732-2705-5b2d-a856-456b9770101f"] [:db/ensure "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316" :question/id #uuid "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316"] [:db/add "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316" :question/problem "Find the general nonzero real solution to the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}+3 \\cdot y=3 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) \\cdot y^{3}.\n$$\n\nWork on an interval where $\\left(x-3\\right)>0$. Choose constants and intervals on which the displayed expressions are real and finite.\n\n{{selection}}"] [:db/add "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316" :question/worked-solution "This is a Bernoulli equation with\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}p(x)&=3\\\\ q(x)&=3 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)\\\\ n&=3.\\end{aligned}$$\n\nDivide by $y^{3}$ and set $z=y^{-2}$. The chain rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{2}{y^{3}}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}.$$\n\nHence the linear equation in standard form is\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}z}{\\mathrm{d}x}+\\left(-6\\right)z=- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right).$$\n\nAn integrating factor is\n\n$$I(x)=e^{\\int -6\\,\\mathrm{d}x}=e^{- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)}.$$\n\nMultiplying through and using the product rule gives\n\n$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(e^{- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)}\\,z\\right)=- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) \\cdot e^{- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)}.$$\n\nIntegrating with respect to $x$, we obtain\n\n$$e^{- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)}z=\\left(\\left(x-3\\right) + \\frac{1}{6}\\right) \\cdot e^{- 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)}+C.$$\n\nThus\n\n$$z=C \\cdot e^{6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + \\left(x-3\\right) + \\frac{1}{6}.$$\n\nFinally, substitute $z=y^{-2}$ and solve for $y$:\n\n$$y=\\pm\\sqrt{\\frac{6}{6 \\cdot C \\cdot e^{6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right)} + 6 \\cdot \\left(x-3\\right) + 1}}.$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant; exclude singularities and restrict to the stated real intervals. Both signs are retained wherever the radicand is positive."] [:db/add "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316" :question/answer-fields "effadeda-4df7-5f84-bf7c-c73637ff4c81"] [:db/ensure "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/questions "b11bcb99-57dd-5f41-b31d-d4bfd1f23316"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "5a3f0623-e47a-507b-9ea1-5718de58b4e5"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/a5/a5a78975059440751ce7ad7285e2b0a0af31608d88e9db1d5ee3958a27345ce4/17592186147454.py"] [:db/add 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186147454 :knowledge-point/validate]]
